                <p class="section-label">Offering #1</p>
                <h2>Resilient Technologies Certification</h2>
                <p>Studio-based certification for people who want to provide resourceful, resilient, sovereign technologies in their communities.</p>
                <p>Attaining skills in resilient technologies is to reclaim ownership of our digital future:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Restoring and reimagining computers</li>
                    <li>Mastering open operating systems</li>
                    <li>Running AI locally</li>
                    <li>Building for the open web</li>
                    <li>Physical computing and sensing</li>
                    <li>Digital fabrication and electronics</li>
                    <li>Deploying lean energy infrastructure</li>
                    <li>Aerial operations</li>
                </ul>
                <p><strong>The programme is inspired by Tairāwhiti</strong>, while being designed to serve any community where the standard technology stack is too expensive, too dependent, or simply doesn't reach.</p>
                <div class="cta-group">
                    <a href="/diploma-pitch" class="cta-link">Programme pitch</a>
