                    <p><em>This proposed programme is being reviewed as a delivery of the New&nbsp;Zealand <strong>Diploma in Information Technology (Level 5)</strong>, <strong>Certificate in Applied Software Development (Level 6)</strong> and <strong>Certificate in Applied Digital Technologies (Level 6)</strong>, and/or a suite of <strong>micro-credentials</strong>.</em></p>
